{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1265,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48ed80fe0dd30b78a02e1319",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脈拍・血圧・睡眠時間、全て正常…\r\nいい1日の始まりだ。試験でも\r\nレースでも、相応の活躍をしよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b47937d95a45ebe898a66074eb3a4c22087ab3416099065bf430e090205745",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f6e0a209722fb4d7a3dba37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今朝も、オペラオー君の演劇に\r\n巻き込まれてね。役を演じるうちに\r\n目が覚めてくる。おすすめだよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00ec53cd4c8a4494c9921c9eb62eb605638a9269054cb20b1bef964d8044ece2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea60657aeacc0ac55fdff858",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昼食の折、ロイス君からファンサの\r\n講義を受けてね。あの見事な分析…\r\n食事を忘れて聞き入ってしまったな",
      "source_fingerprint": "f762a7fc01c8aafca88ee5722a0234be3e239e3ede4f3d3d1940910f88e1cbf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95972671a162b0c6620474d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放課後、図書室でメサイア君によく\r\n会う。いつも気になる本を読んで\r\nいてね…つい積読が増えてしまうよ",
      "source_fingerprint": "101ca223e0be6a706a77d492f591967864d8ecd78b633f5ca72031ff41b4611e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30df9e4c1f5a84227a8f530b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜間の外出は極力避けたい。\r\nこの服は、全体的に発光するゆえ…\r\nその…注目を集めすぎてな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e745d1c110b7dbe79b9827c134d71c10984abffa8c545de38f3fe435ae1dae39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21cfc577dded103244cd0cd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ブライアン、風呂上がりの髪を\r\n放置する習慣は変わっていないか…\r\n今夜は一緒に髪を乾かすとするか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f6ca437764491ee63bacfa8758231538d00fce65e20e3ab61e412c2de48fa60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b81bc3c74abf93924ed2c4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "入学記念に買った今の関数電卓…\r\nこいつとどれだけの難問を解いて\r\nきたか。まだ買い替える気はないよ",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c636ead4275c26e9df5c6c812b0f4a27747ebec6a89d5fac295bc382fbf7d6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4e87611a854d7b7681b8ca2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服の冷却装置で真夏も快適さ。\r\nひんやりする、とチケットが\r\nくっついてくるほどだ…ふふ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0827a274068ee97efc79d01a6124ddce6ed3cd6e90fad54b5b6e035cbe12ba5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d998e8b78152a996ad119160",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "矢の角度や的までの距離…弓道は、\r\n分析次第で的中率を上げられる。\r\n運動の秋だし、久々にやろうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc8963099f40eab4193af9bfc20de61137778cc2bf821e7143a95b715216f41d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bfbe6be3492d862c8c2b837",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "甘酒は冬バテ対策に優れている。\r\n小さい頃、母がよく作ってくれてね\r\n…不思議と心まで温かくなるんだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8173419c81979b7c18b0008313fcaa9072ab711b3f8ce67d0b75777da9fdd43c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:877b2b93b40a899cea0da78a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン",
      "source_fingerprint": "205aa64f55aa5b5868c584cadc0b5dcd8e05b84b0a76c8efb1da86986277c562",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd6a6c5408e87de0cd17be68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管书有多厚，\r\n大进一定都会把它看完。不过……\r\n她的感想很随便就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0290d3f61713c61b07ec7fbc1b736823a1a5fb5d733fe61ca7f7f43124212e2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6609b651bff24c91b0e96844",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前几天奖券拜托我教她功课……\r\n不要紧，理论上应该能……\r\n回避掉考不及格的危机。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed56f4873afd929e85a2d570212be2cac20d83e5049157b5c3795daa43cc4eff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f2c07a926ec4f573996c386",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近的推理剧很优秀。像是\r\n值得考察的伏笔，还有人际关系……\r\n害我洗完澡之后不小心看入迷了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7738370e8bc13c1965ff134ba094fea78c05e6329f019a4e4e3835a11d2316f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36f42849a104cc55284e3569",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这阵子房里有毛毛虫出没……\r\n鼓起一身毛扭动的模样……\r\n啊啊，光是回想起来就毛骨悚然！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd338ca6e2c9b16d93a75ccf78268da08b639242ced7e250883de13ca16d195e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49c042a5dd3ee081ff5e2804",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈来跟我抱怨\r\n白仁都联系不上。\r\n真是……当姐姐真辛苦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e548e700a7d4de589c668fbbab0a0a9d84cccbfdf5e82bd8253c4c0e455a3bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dc4d85e196884f9e8580849",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛状况我大致可以预料，\r\n可是舞台的不确定要素太多了。\r\n所以我才会紧张吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cae8ea2c955c66b52aa9142b919eb5750e8e1b5ee75827c1669d3d69ba57649a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b68c7c969ae6d85295768ee9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我应该算是不太会唱歌跳舞那种人。\r\n不过……只要有人希望我登台，\r\n我就会努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ce20858337fe379d7c7a0dddca0bd534dd7e9da3c75d1a174bd3774f23ea14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b0ffdf1104a7c0a7c6ea706",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们比赛时的模样，\r\n就该深深烙印在观众记忆里……\r\n这个款式的震撼性应该无可挑剔吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0833168e5934be215a76e3f7c1e760b3e4b49b77c4e1e5e50dae381638a79d7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d83ddd117580c9a6b24e8ee1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套决胜服展现了我的决心。\r\n总有一天，我一定要完成\r\n自己的「方程式」……赢得一切。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1219f8d9623ec2a4061401958af9de40cad6f19193098e35030adc0ed8c8ac01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c868627a5a6e94855b73367",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上的例行计划一旦被打乱，\r\n我会一整天都坐立难安。\r\n所以我会花时间调整自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fa94a459b76d048a88c4060fa6df2fd45997f64145a742363831a56009af0cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a9af5e8107a636dc6d39f75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了有效活用下午时段，\r\n午餐应该吃八分饱就好。\r\n……除非遇到爱吃的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37bc011285db38dc50d8a6e1049105b61e8dcd2fc50fcf1900bf28cb87f91170",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bbbd86e18584c6336168555",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まずは小手調べ…。\r\n君の力量を測らせてもらおう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66a694b4b72414818c06349a988769212d8cc1cb799be81be195ce98f4b28293",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12f1eee7d0ced76e0a8bb6c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你在就寝时能够立刻入睡吗？\r\n自省已经成了我的习惯……\r\n如果有办法赶快睡着，拜托你告诉我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22093849ce6894020a6a35b66d208cb1092acac3343c6ea8fe88fa9754fb983c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4163c813ac105ccc948619cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢春天。毕竟花开得很灿烂。\r\n而且在跑步时发现花朵，\r\n还会带来表现变好的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22b0447323334d323f220c0d6351d2d79238320b0110ce978584b071759f1f8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f36b3c7aecbe00dae5b14ee1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "营养均衡的饮食\r\n能有效防止中暑……\r\n不过白仁她就是挑食呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc254e3c08dd88cc6e5fe7fc5578eec25a37e59d2dacaaca3f68ee917a29774a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d225f4f2e4b32e146593557",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天的夜晚很适合看书。\r\n虽然类型各有不同，\r\n不过我会替你挑选几部推荐书刊的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20b1a3a381afbf5b93a8dff16e894d1172d26d2c3321f37cdd13297064d8d922",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:408e51ebd068eacf7bbfb7a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "攻击与回避的精密交锋……！\r\n我和奖券及大进交手过了，\r\n打雪仗还挺好玩的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b32add150eb25982db456a2af5cd8d20af6512855aab6de9ba431daceac25a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:753f60f03ced598558cc98e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我以前曾陪妹妹一起做过姜饼人。\r\n我陪她重做了非常非常多次，\r\n直到她能顺利画好脸为止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ccc7164e27c05dcaca9b23e76383747952654920fb88c61a74666f79b7f0baa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f505507b87628497bf43caf9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「有个胡子乱糟糟的圣诞老人」\r\n好像流传着这样的传闻……\r\n不过我的头发……可没有乱糟糟的喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a556262afbb6f553815dede5e2f71f353ec6de39ddb6a7c6e14118fcd7414b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27ebbeec833cf65f534bf561",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才我见到了素质。\r\n莫名地很有亲近感喔。\r\n……或许是颜色的关系吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2cacd89f3bbc812ccd2d734d7a80bbd8b4ed1e7e531bd8423d9a7af3987211b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e003bbe844a435264db5c8a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "重炮跟我说她想穿这套服装。\r\n……我听了虽然开心，\r\n但也担心会不会滑下来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb42b7821a08af8bacd54064bfcc3836e09297ad9b1b32149aa67ecb52d19cd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba76f0b2e5ddbe660b157cc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家拿了星星又拿了胡子过来……\r\n到底是想要圣诞树还是圣诞老人，\r\n至少统一一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0db14088f7d7107f1fd0fa7f0c4d095b17f1027a02fa909319969b9bcf9f9b6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4d485c684bc30f93c80d0a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不知道如果像以前一样\r\n在袜子里放糖果，\r\n白仁会露出什么样的表情……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c3f1bdcd33cc50c185109f7063fb9e70f503c6944a75a7e2c604c9f62a3ff80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89a10d21410348f2aba34e56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在打扫时间带着白色袋子，\r\n学妹们看到都眼睛一亮……\r\n……我该随身带着礼物才对吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c324846db00aebfeaa12cd6b935b79fbcbb187dc50df3e00fc129d2eb0a00ee5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b972a1ebe99cc13a8f2f68d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔在外面吃个饭怎么样？\r\n找餐厅的事就交给我吧。\r\n我最擅长找出行家才知道的店了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76995425f2ff2261343ed71818ea9b6150f1b8a8109240c287faa685522dd78f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3846f628acb05649e83b43a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪花融化，进入了灿烂的季节……\r\n虽然松了口气，\r\n但又莫名有种落寞的心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e88bec39869e3ad285687abb271af31668e1bed4d36055c9a9b08a3a4308080",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b04f43ec9cec12b7b3fa994",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有点……不对，是相当炎热呢。\r\n暂时在冷气下面凉快一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "640bb0e36f16124873fd755826cf6a52b42c41951307d8949246148d3ab0009e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c27a073fd77cbf3199ec839",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想好想要的东西了吗？\r\n差不多该做出决定了，\r\n不然圣诞老人可能会伤脑筋喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec14c95506b74f3c530fa0da609c5a803f60c7cea6362735bff0526954d3a415",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7d61c7cde1654fecfcf4b68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "坐雪橇时要小心一点。\r\n只要一滑下坡就没人能止住。\r\n──简直就是所谓的彻底失控。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c4ee1e8fdc1631a21ed2f009b265457942698b33798d9b78f2b4ab4ac85f32b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dd12f8b91989a4585cb0c28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有点担心头饰的部分。\r\n如果看起来快要掉了，\r\n希望你立刻告诉我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ec628354be62f341671021628b87341b9af415d5fcd920bd62bcc7d258714ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cd53baa19d78771edf549d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "指甲很鲜艳吧？都不觉得这是\r\n自己的手，会忍不住一直盯着看。\r\n感觉好新鲜喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58b46d1fbc8464fe8c679e5a0a95d5e5f3a30fff119567742278448dd78d348c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20fb9ac0fa6155536a2c73eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヘアアレンジで、あんなに私の髪が\r\n少なく見えるとは…！フライト君の\r\nあの技、私にもできるだろうか…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2299e63491fe6acf43292805eaf9c78de8fd2dd90590c4ece8c98e6a6c1e4702",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f15e5e75c50d66ef162478df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユキノ君の宿題を手伝ったら、\r\n編み物の眼鏡ケースをくれたんだ。\r\n手作りとはな…大切にしよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5ae30b0b2227495a5501beb9a1a7eb400a926c8b0ac5ba42b15d2d3383cd6da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fd01e45ed4ba74c73d81efe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリスエス君が、海外にいる両親に\r\n日本酒を贈りたい、と。どの銘柄が\r\nいいか…ふふ、まずは父に相談だな",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9376c78d22a76a6ad3d7abc3f117e4fe3ac87636940993970add51279dceac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aeef2b166ac7fc2d86f2418",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シャカール君と幾何学の難問に\r\n挑んだんだ。何度も試行錯誤したが\r\n…解けた瞬間、凄い達成感だった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b15b1dd4f0805d62fdf1fa004b3103b422586dd764788ddb50d429da8faf4753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ceebbbce5db8e1ed64d4e41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ギムレット君は同室のブライアンに\r\n手を焼いていないだろうか…\r\n『混沌こそ秩序』と笑っていたが…",
      "source_fingerprint": "162a355e41105b4e793d88a9ddc110a1f32372963eb8b388f49ce3d02be66629",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1f299fe0604991a81d6c122",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毎朝、トップロード君が皆に挨拶を\r\nするおかげで、私の教室は明るい。\r\n良好な関係を築く術…私も見習おう",
      "source_fingerprint": "a37eecefb3c5575c850bd740b68f5167b2ce066723eafe37184ffe1b5dc870d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d17f4fe96debc43ff50f99a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昼休憩は機械工学の本を読むんだ。\r\n駆動制御はフォームの参考になる。\r\n私の方程式にも活かせるだろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a3c1e2d8c79e26c84959621ee5bdcaf99715c7152f62acab79fd2e8052e9260",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9c2ff3c5ead20f3e4aa4d33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今夜、ライツ博士推薦のSF小説を\r\n読むとしよう。リアリティに満ちた\r\n近未来か…夜ふかしには注意だな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43cdca3611d8c15c52551797abfeef5232a168387a67e38b919307ff9e3334de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea147c91cf513db6083823ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふぁ…春の暖かさは眠気を誘うな。\r\nなぜこうも眠いのか…そうだ、\r\n睡眠アプリで眠りの質を見てみるか",
      "source_fingerprint": "707ef7b1cf3c34710e6cacd4ff42917acea71f38f5d5195cff07854aaa8ff052",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b4a3361afb14e597d9a8c7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "また夏限定のバナナスイーツか…！\r\nくっ、この季節は体重管理アプリが\r\n必須だな。気を引き締めなければ…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6c0472eb4fdfcd955ace95d608ca186f7f105a92440dbf4be45ddba42481149",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:192458f81126c2d35bde840a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋は古本祭りが楽しみだ。誰かの\r\n努力が滲んだ参考書を見ていると…\r\n自然と、背筋が正される。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea0b80848ca24458489b48c568c2547f6673d159c99ddc7627ef7d0a202537ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:974d3feb882c725d595453dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪だるまなら任せてくれ。美しい\r\n球形であり、安定感も抜群だぞ。\r\n昔、ブライアンにも絶賛された程だ",
      "source_fingerprint": "814c004b3c0b2e969656af2bd969ce2a84c7f2dd85d7a6b2593b6ccf0ec851c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9297becea6284ddc0d69f282",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうかな、トレーナー君！\r\nいつもよりさらさらだろう？最新の\r\n電動ヘアブラシは凄いな…ふふっ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "223fce94a2c69cf200a4812de4ba16025a35aa3b26fc4d44a44261dd51771fb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f26eb6e4adbfe69266b254c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "強度、重量、視力の矯正度数…\r\nこのバイザーに一切の妥協はない。\r\n体の一部も同然、だからね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5250a968e332d72eea9ea605989e6028663d668381fec6935e7bbb3ad5893bd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34a170480ba2c11b95cc03b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「具有逻辑并充满效率」……\r\n这是训练的理想状况。\r\n我们彼此加油吧，训练员君。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba430ace8a105b7f99852f4121f14a15f87aa0af8a7b2416416d4e773aeb5198",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32a6cc726aa5274526fa24aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくぞっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1ae48257d0805dcd2123dc155ce6b9f73292e838d06ccd81047d6c2cbb246a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee7e29b57a046c53d19ec272",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "反复进行很重要这个道理，\r\n不管运用在检讨理论或训练都一样。\r\n让我们绷紧神经好好努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "498110b21338639910eb05b41578c610168184d00932dd99a06a667951f8643b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:184dffaa82465191a179ddc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才我脑中浮现了一个假说。\r\n我可以套用在训练中加以验证吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b50422a9a02e41c6bec2b62891fb7f7241ec74922667a66031afd080b482a3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:959af65835d9fa3de1f4c40e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员君，趁现在让我\r\n掌握指导方针吧。\r\n我会遵照你的方针进行准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3b3279e9e51e0197b4ce1efa6ec3a091095a6b4162b56ff2cbf52c5e0943375",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e9248c64ec34f6646704477",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你讨论训练项目，\r\n逐渐变成了我每天的乐趣。\r\n呵呵，今天也要麻烦你了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d21d39fa1a5651a23bbeaa01589f1bb82b93e39364b30546f5e0930af9c07749",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bca3fdfa46870ec17556ea01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力总有一天必定会开花结果──\r\n就跟训练员君一样，\r\n我也是如此深信着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "301af4e61c95e70d2cd192b72b95b3b6171da33492e66559a5949f538bad3c53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e02a2f565861d0d36a6e17a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都是因为有你这个知音相助，\r\n我才能埋首训练。请你好好期待\r\n我以结果报答你的那天吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e06319ce1329b042cc7c41995992ecb08c90137ace122145766f6e0c2e763817",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42974ffc2d3b37dfe3ce038f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想顺畅地进行练习。\r\n假如我讲话太拐弯抹角……\r\n还请你尽管出言指正。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40f60b7b722cdc2b3c8f42fffbbba98cfe5bf69c13782640d57e9b6905a369c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00165266f7be685918d0a428",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了将祝福献给大家──\r\n来，开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eea6e8afb5bab4762cb1a0aaad304a7fb64947651bf389f05084c6804f9b0a30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04822a77683913fc6ff587e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练时顺便进行\r\n发礼物的练习吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c71b5d4fd59f56e2ab450b51586c8cd5ce023e480b75639d94da1a2907a8dee6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8303aac04d9536b25ed1b77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用担心，没问题的。\r\n这套衣服做得比看起来\r\n更适合奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b76ce2a25f93c3be84148b5980dbcb821943be40cbb24f21c011b0b3b79dff72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e995ee6667186cfb65f58b3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管衣装如何，\r\n我都清楚自己该走的路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ad45dee119129c4f7d32b483ec2aed1c612931571349de329320e1dbbf6ab9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10d4b43d787ace40f86fba92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果我的奔驰能够\r\n带给他人幸福──\r\n……唔，这样也挺不赖的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a80dde64e23a16922d745731fcee89116b7d48b635ca0318b1dedd4caab41b57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56e831443e6a71234643556c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我发誓一定会送给训练员\r\n你盼望的胜利当作礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d84fdde1505f9da13b0fdb5f592d0f759371b6853613e13d1598584d9b0afc5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecde9012086e57d43feb3557",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就如同你为我祈祷的一样，\r\n我也祈祷你能\r\n获得幸福喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5699a6121524faea2915101e7e07571178ca15485c033f199f93a402beb38d7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f5048ccc11d96b472258998",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングの予測演算完了だ。\r\n私の理論が正しいか否か…\r\n結果で証明しよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2df9de039032e0e69aa971fbf47899deb1c1f6efe579a0d409eb80766da7bc13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62fa5208c1b7d985977c2f17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パーツのメンテナンスなら完璧だ。\r\n負荷耐久試験もクリアしている。\r\nどんなメニューでもこなせるぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e24e9e12e2fc74289ce5e65cc291140f5c1533d2470460952953a0d0c667150d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b665b6a30c9e07a71a9d864b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "機械工学にトライアル＆エラーは\r\n付き物…トレーニングも同じ、\r\n間違っていたら再挑戦するだけさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eccf5cd7a71f785d9c2259335bac0d0c0f1934e15ba0cdf868339b132cc69e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f7413d4117dd262fcd91ccb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "先ほど、このイヤホンで音楽を\r\n聴いたんだ。好きな曲は集中力を\r\n上げる効果がある…いい状態だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd73f21973cb837728aeeb378f63df5214dc06317aa3c6c27383e909def2897a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ca99ebaf330770d4e158ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君と検討を重ねたタスク…\r\n勝利に近づくため、\r\nしっかり果たしてみせよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b5c23fc7aae5c632ac7927b4054622a80c3855050872bac14e65784793c2f8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0baa4051e749cd39f1d217dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "意見があれば遠慮なく言ってくれ。\r\n組み立てた理論のわずかな誤差…\r\nなくすためには、君の力が必要だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69b3a4a31d50385ed0218789b6598c588a21e90fb234cd272ee06908507ecd15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cabe7cf190f120ec98aabf83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誰にも負けない“勝利の方程式”…\r\nきっと、君とだからこそ\r\n辿り着けるんだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "401fae0ccf29ba798b42f6b1da4c840e74a2d77b823af4c2aa7445c1d9769bfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
